{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e-o210","title":"从猎射鹿三发三中，太祖叹韩文约可尽节，英跪答不欺明公而流涕","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-9a33b3e40beaa92a62c2","label":"裴注·典略","text":"从猎射鹿三发三中，太祖叹韩文约可尽节，英跪答不欺明公而流涕","evidence":["liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"命英射三鹿，抵掌称但韩文约可为尽节，而孤独不可乎；嘉其敦旧，遂亲敬之","evidence":["liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf"]},{"person":"liusima-p0032","role":"三发三中皆应弦而倒，乃下马而跪曰不欺明公，假使英本主人在，实不来此也，遂流涕哽咽","evidence":["liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf","source_order":[15,179,319],"order":3310}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liusima-p0032","name":"成公英","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-fe0f3567e6b3112d284b","layer":"pei","quote":"从行出猎，有三鹿走过前。公命英射之，三发三中，皆应弦而倒。公抵掌谓之曰：‘但韩文约可为尽节，而孤独不可乎？’英乃下马而跪曰：‘不欺明公。假使英本主人在，实不来此也。’遂流涕哽咽。公嘉其敦旧，遂亲敬之","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":319,"end":418,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
